'''Bunny & Canard''' are an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Easter Carnival (Gacha Event)|Easter Carnival]] event. This unit is a reskin of [[Warlock and Pierre (Uber Rare Cat)|Warlock & Pierre]] that attacks different types of enemies. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]] grants [[Immune to Toxic|Toxic]] and [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immunity]] but loses [[Zombie Killer]] and switches its target to [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemies.

