==Trivia==
*In [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] of the [[The Battle Cats|English Version]], Disciple Psychoduck's [[Cat Guide]] entry used the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese Version]]'s unlock hint.
*Canard is French for duck.
*Despite the description stating that it has "[[Massive Damage|Massive Damage]]", it doesn't multiply the damage output, therefore it refers to its base attack power.
*There was a typo in the Evolved Form's description: "it attacks Zombies and not Darks".
**This was corrected in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]] of [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

